35,2,1,talk,Shion,,The wall is paper-thin. Conversations leak out. The bins are overflowing with crumbs. We are a mess.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found the invoices. Sixty-eight thousand yen for nine bookings, but never more than four people. It’s a waste.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, the tally says two people hogged it eleven times! And the awkward talk happened right here. We need rules!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, twenty-five minutes for a hot meal is a long journey. We must ask if this room can shorten that distance for us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
