41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I also checked the old fridge. Half the food was from nobody. We keep paying for things we don’t even use.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, that’s why people hide! If the room feels scary, nobody wants to use it. We need a safe spot, not just a quiet one!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
